H('252.d.2.B',4,"A student who lists deadlines for applications, FAFSA, and scholarships is:","Creating a postsecondary plan",["Skipping college","Avoiding aid","Ignoring costs"],"Planning organizes steps.")
H('252.d.3.A',3,"Cash, checks, debit cards, and credit cards are all:","Forms of financial exchange",["Forms of taxes","Types of loans only","Types of insurance"],"They transfer value.")
