H('252.d.5.C',4,"When the supply of money in banks increases, interest rates tend to:","Fall",["Rise","Stay fixed","Double"],"More supply lowers price.")
H('252.d.5.D',3,"The Federal Reserve is the nation's:","Central bank",["Largest retailer","Tax agency","Court"],"The Fed oversees monetary policy.")
