H('252.d.8.H',3,"Placing a fraud alert on your credit file is an example of:","Identity theft protection",["Bad credit","Tax filing","Budgeting"],"Alerts guard against misuse.")
H('252.d.8.H',4,"Monitoring your accounts regularly helps you:","Spot unauthorized activity quickly",["Raise limits","Lose track","Lower scores"],"Early detection limits damage.")
