H('252.d.10.C',3,"Weighing tuition costs against future earnings is investigating:","The costs and opportunities of postsecondary education",["Hobbies","Taxes","Rent"],"Education is an investment.")
H('252.d.10.C',4,"Which cost should be included when estimating total college expense?","Tuition, housing, books, and fees",["Only tuition","Only housing","Nothing"],"Include all costs.")
